-- Homogeneous reducers and stateful prefix machines share the same ordered stream. Every scan is length-preserving on that stream, and every nonempty fold is its final prefix.
--! registry ../registries/030-scans.reg

--! out 3 4 8 10 15
+\ Weight @ Route

--! out 2 6 9 18
*\ Multiplier @ comboChain

--! out 3 1 1 1 1
min\ Height @ Ray

--! out 3 2 2.6666666666666665 2.5 3
avg\ Weight @ Route

--! out 1 1 2 3 3 4 4 5
#\ Route

--! out 0 0 0 0 1
(+\ Weight @ Route) == (+/ Weight @ Route)
